✅ Problem 1: Contest Registration Percentage

Calculated the percentage of users registered for each contest.

SELECT
    r.contest_id,
    ROUND(
        COUNT(r.user_id) * 100.0 /
        (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM Users),
        2
    ) AS percentage
FROM Register r
GROUP BY r.contest_id
ORDER BY percentage DESC, contest_id ASC;

✅ Problem 2: Query Quality & Poor Query Analysis

Analyzed search query performance using quality scores and poor-performing query percentages.

select query_name, 
round(avg(rating/position),2) as quality,
round((count(case when rating < 3 then 1 end)/count(*))*100,2) as poor_query_percentage 
from queries 
group by query_name
